                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. 发光鱿鱼" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="Java版发光鱿鱼不受“Dinnerbone”和“Grumm”名称彩蛋的影响。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 干草捆" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="干草捆的截图起初被发现于Mojang游戏Nuke the Dinosaurs中。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 灾厄村民" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="灾厄村民冰术师是Minecraft Live 2020生物投票中的候选生物之一，计划生成在高山生物群系。它在第二轮投票中被淘汰。" />
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
